        "TileImage": "$($repository 9f6b010a-b4cc-4bda-8200-f132aaad03a4).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Your primary target is Lawrence Hunt, household staff, who has spent eleven months sitting on the bonnet of our client&apos;s car. He has been asked to stop. He has instead grown comfortable. Deal with him at all cost. Your second target is Samuel Taylor, who traded a fryer for a security badge and now guards the manor&apos;s women staff rather more closely than anyone requested. He calls it vigilance. Our client` calls it a problem.\r\rgl 47",
